<section class="section"><div class="container"><h2>Who is part of the community?</h2>
<p>Our community connects data stewards, research data managers, and professionals working in research support, infrastructure, libraries, Open Science, and related areas.</p>
<p>We welcome people from universities, research institutes, research infrastructures, and other organisations who share an interest in strengthening the profession.</p>
</div></section>
<section class="section section-soft"><div class="container"><h2>What connects us?</h2><div class="card-grid">
<article class="card"><h3>Exchange</h3><p>Share experiences, discuss challenges, and learn from colleagues across institutional and disciplinary boundaries.</p></article>
<article class="card"><h3>Collaboration</h3><p>Develop ideas, shared initiatives, and joint activities that benefit the wider community.</p></article>
<article class="card"><h3>Collective voice</h3><p>Strengthen the visibility, recognition, and strategic influence of data stewardship.</p></article>
</div></div></section>
